{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"2087c5a4666698da30ce404c1522824f658028a87a3d7e3b34f27cbf3602b841","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"dcfd031f93528025ae4e20dcce875805317ed94d02a1b64c3c7c696ed6b2eeca","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"de010befadb30a314e41c3d011d9d48ac526781bba885795e92f3116e238270b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon-seeds.lua:56 原文写明火焰箭射向“foes in sight”（视野内的敌人），译文没有写出目标范围，玩家看不出火焰箭打向谁；flame bolts 译成“火球”也和 bolt（箭矢类弹道）不符。DLC 来源版本未固定。"},{"revision_key":"de5854b6490f22ca119ce6a4f91a2233f264350f6c36731cdb8172e7e08c8f22","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/demon.lua:316 有多处意义错误和漏译：“holding the front lines against the hordes of Eyal”是抵御埃亚尔大军，不是“奋战在埃亚尔边界前线”；“study new magical spells for our arsenal”被误译为“学习兵工厂新的魔法”；漏译 towering creations；“very much machines, made with bolstered muscles without losing the clever minds”和“As eager as they are brilliant”被整句改写成“钢铁般的纪律”。跨条问题：children of onyx 在本条译作“玛瑙色的孩子们／玛瑙战士”，在同批 e6985dcd 条译作“缟玛瑙之子们”，同一势力名前后不一致。"},{"revision_key":"df20e157440ab49d977d44d1ad8a5ec8b92dc730c9fb0bd6b24f3203ef8b5be8","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"df5ab191262015cda6abdc60ab9de3f096eefe794b85bc2fc67509a4e5998a70","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e1e756022713bcb549c86cd63bbf4c4d0b84217bf8afc23e84b390d2f6ce25e7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e20983d04a4722472b0367bfd22108d2adebbc879d2d6fcc7008e12ef94df1e9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e6985dcdeca1588eefe0bcbc083c6736bc39dd7c6b60f1e6d9e38fab14d8074a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/demon.lua:377 原文“heating raw metal with their magic until it is workable, then pounding it into their shape”说的是用魔法把金属加热到可加工，再用锤子捶打成形；译文“将其导入模具中”与原文相反，也与后文锤头可拆换、每一锤都能产出装备的描述冲突。“energy-efficient creation”（制造时的能耗效率）被误译为“能量燃率”；“父亲大人”是原文没有的添加。跨条问题：children of onyx 在本条作“缟玛瑙之子们”，与 de5854b6 条的“玛瑙色的孩子们”不一致。"},{"revision_key":"e781f9306f0e88ecd58067161dd9caa7a69bd4bebd85b2e718dbc3c7e696e09a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/demon.lua:478 “recovered an intact one”意为找回一个完好无损的传送门，译文“未被人使用过的”意义错误。“the consequences of failure were too awful to risk inflicting on other test subjects”意为他不愿让其他受试者承担失败的可怕后果，所以亲自进入传送门；译文“实施其他实验的失败后果太过危险”说成了“其他实验”，丢掉了他自愿替代受试者的动机，而这正是结尾“无私奉献”的依据。"},{"revision_key":"e7f6cac45636258afab312140a86a32d7c4cd9b27f13ea612747f59796920e49","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"wrath.lua:133-134 tformat 的第二个参数是 t.fireRadius，对应原文“burst of fire in radius %d”。译文把半径写死为“3 码”，又把这个 %d 挪到“击退 %d 码”上，于是运行时把火焰爆发半径显示成击退距离，而原文没有给出击退距离。另外，“火焰伤害”“包括目标”在冻结片段中找不到依据（原文只写 dealing %d damage），片段也未包含 getDamage 的伤害类型。DLC 来源版本未固定。"},{"revision_key":"e8b56851f137662867a0e4cf29385b5a4320eb10097c17866f156546120147d6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ea1d8fcb0b64e634030eb0c5fe37dbc85d0f8399d01079b3d2601a3b6ac52a17","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demonic-pact.lua:700 原文“Implanting a seed into unique demons ... will always try to grant a seed of that type, if available”限定对象是 unique demons（唯一恶魔），而且是“总会尝试”。译文扩大为所有“史诗生物（Unique）”，又把“尝试”改成“必定会获得”，把适用范围和不确定性都说错了。同样，第 688 行“a demonic seed tries to take hold”被译成确定植入，删掉了 tries，与下文按宿主级别给出的寄生几率表矛盾。另有“眩晕 敌人”多一个空格。"},{"revision_key":"eb38d586e7308527eab2644743dd5081bbedbf1c593abb263f93973f0eca7d60","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:110 “cloak shaped flames”是斗篷形状的火焰（该物品是 Fearfire Mantle，desc 为黑色火焰），中心词是火焰。译文“火焰般的斗篷”把中心词和修饰语颠倒了，应表达为斗篷状的火焰。"},{"revision_key":"ebb709fd1b3014abfabf6738e5d1500f4612372b4e5d70d76643ee768b573bf0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ee89209326cf70a26b2e5b60089e53eaae69122e9da291ef178c8ce86347f272","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f13d578c105ef5a5aa4d9da0fc47128ae6b87b21ba0ac7c6f19be7dc8e4d31e6","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:789 The Black Maul 的 desc 原文是带引号的一句话“A fitting weapon for the Champion.”（配得上冠军／勇士的武器），译文“冠军之锤，举重若轻”完全改写了原意，凭空添加“举重若轻”，还删掉了原文的引号。"},{"revision_key":"f3b3b2e5abdbf359607b1ac31ece00f9f57185a847dc519da400c1410b10ec12","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f402d6591d249317cb8ed765e520f64849a1e083cf6e7f8a17b1bd061148ccde","verdict":"OK"}]}